id: wikipedia-zoom
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: The GPU path, zoom: double-tap the infobox and pinch on desktop en.wikipedia.org: the page at the new zoom arrives (the stream's spacing says how promptly) and no area stays grey (the stream's uniform bands)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R6
known: T-567 stream-uniform
needs: internet
stream: --rows 83-1024 --still 29-83
stream-mojo: --rows 84-945
wait rect 'sel:.infobox' 60
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
stream-start 20 -c 170-600 -U 48
dtap 560 420
wait zoom 10
expect zoom-min 1.3
pinch 384 500 400 100
wait zoom 10
pinch 384 500 400 100
wait zoom 10
pinch 384 500 400 100
wait still 0,100,756,700 6
stream-stop
expect zoom 0.69 0.12
expect content 0,100,756,700 'sel:body'
expect text-has 'sel:#firstHeading' TouchPad
expect stream uniform 0
